  "step_3": "The decision reason requires comparing the maximum outcomes (since probability differences are negligible) and preferring the one with the higher maximum outcome. The individual, however, bases the decision on the certainty and simplicity of B's single positive outcome, not on the maximum outcome comparison. There is no mention of the 4000 Euro outcome of A or any evaluation of maximum outcomes. Therefore, the individual did not apply the decision reason. The reported justification is inconsistent with the rule of the reason. The individual used a different reasoning principle (certainty of outcome) rather than the maximum outcome rule.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
